{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人王灝兒（JW）早前宣布婚訊，與至尊沙田班主王至尊拉埋天窗，全城祝賀。</p><p>日前至尊沙田重金禮聘前西班牙國腳大衞施華落場效力，而JW身穿短裙仔現身力撐老公球隊，落場獻唱《矛盾一生》和新歌《JW²情歌》。</p><p>JW更盡地主之誼，昨晚（9日）上載與大衞施</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T18:25:14.623826+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T18:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T18:18:30.999966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T18:18:30.999966+00:00","content_hash":"439fa23bcb7240a1ff6145339f5717dd00e9c671af7bf208eb8f960f1b476cd6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}